{"strongs": "H6529", "word": "פְּרִי", "translit": "pe.ri", "root": "פרי", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "fruit", "definition": "פְּרִי 119 noun masculine Hos 14:9 fruit ; — absolute ׳ פ Hos 9:16 +, פֶּ֑רִי Jer 12:12 +; especially construct פְּרִי Gen 4:3 +; suffix פִּרְיִי Prov 8:19 , פֶּרְיְךָ Hos 14:9 , פִּרְיוֺ Gen 3:6 +, וּפֶרְיְכֶם Ezek 36:8 , פְּרִיהֶם Amos 9:14 , פִּרְיָם Lam 2:20 +, פִּרְיָמוֺ Ps 21:11 , פְּרִיהֶן Jer 29:28 , פִּרְיָן v Jer 29:5 , etc.; — 1. פְּרִי הָאֲרָמָה Gen 4:3 ( J ), fruit of the ground , of produce in general, so Deut 7:13 + 9 t. Deuteronomy + 3 t.; הָאֶרֶץ ׳ פ Num 13:20 ; Num 13:26 ; Num 13:27 ( J E ) + 5 t., compare Ezek 25:4 fruit of vineyard 2Kgs 19:29 = Isa 37:30 ; Zech 8:12 ; Isa 65:21 ; Song 8:11 ; Song 8:12 , in figure Hos 10:11 + 5 t. + Ezek 17:14 (but strike out ᵐ5 Co and others); especially הָעֵץ ׳ פ Gen 3:2 ; Gen 3:3 ; Gen 3:6 ; Exod 10:15 (all J ) + 21 t., also, in figure, Amos 2:9 ; Hos 9:16 + 4 t. + Ezek 17:23 (read פּאֹרָה branches Co and others); of gardens Amos 9:14 ; Jer 29:5 ; Jer 29:28 , figurative Song 4:12 ; Song 4:16 עֵץ פְּרִי is fruit-tree Gen 1:11 ; Ps 148:9 , compare Eccl 2:5 אֶרֶץ פְּרִי Ps 107:34 פְּרִי תְּבוּאָךְ v Ps 107:37 fruit of (consisting in) a crop ; Ps 72:16 is dubious; Che Du interpret as 2 ; Bae proposes יִפְרוּ . 2. = offspring: fruit of womb ( בֶּטֶן ) Gen 30:2 ; Deut 7:13 + 9 t., compare Lam 2:20 ; Ps 21:11 of cattle ( בְּהֵמָה ) Deut 28:4 ; Deut 28:11 ; Deut 28:51 ; Deut 30:9 of serpent, figurative of power conquering Philistia Isa 14:29 . 3. figurative of fruit of actions, i.e. their consequences: good Isa 3:10 ; Ps 58:12 bad Hos 10:13 ; Prov 1:31 ; Mic 7:13 , of thoughts Jer 6:19 of result of removing sin Isa 27:9 result of labour ( fruit of hands) Prov 31:16 ; Prov 31:31 product of works of ׳ י Ps 104:13 , of wisdom Prov 8:19 צְדָקָה ׳ פ Amos 6:12 , compare צַדִּיק ׳ פ Prov 11:30 (read צֶדֶק ᵐ5 Hi Toy); of doings (i.e. course of life, or character) Jer 17:10 ; Jer 21:14 ; Jer 32:19 פִיאִֿישׁ ׳ פ i.e. speech Prov 12:14 ; Prov 13:2 ; Prov 18:20 fruit of arrogance Isa 10:12 is arrogant speech; fruit of tongue Prov 18:21 = consequences of speech. I, II. פָּרָה see III. פרר . פֶּרֶה see פֶּרֶא . [ פֵּרָה ], פֵּרוֺת Isa 2:20 see [ חֲפַרְפָּרָה ].", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6763')\">BDB6763</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6529')\">H6529</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6762')\">BDB6762</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6764')\">BDB6764</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>פְּרִי</bdbheb><sub>119</sub> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Hos 14:9\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(28,14,9)\">Hos 14:9</ref></sup> <highlightword>fruit</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>פ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 9:16\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(28,9,16)\">Hos 9:16</ref> +, <bdbheb>פֶּ֑רִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 12:12\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(24,12,12)\">Jer 12:12</ref> +; especially construct <bdbheb>פְּרִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 4:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,4,3)\">Gen 4:3</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>פִּרְיִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 8:19\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,19)\">Prov 8:19</ref>, <bdbheb>פֶּרְיְךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 14:9\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(28,14,9)\">Hos 14:9</ref>, <bdbheb>פִּרְיוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 3:6\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(1,3,6)\">Gen 3:6</ref> +, <bdbheb>וּפֶרְיְכֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 36:8\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(26,36,8)\">Ezek 36:8</ref>, <bdbheb>פְּרִיהֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 9:14\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"14\" o