sa 37:30\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(23,37,30)\">Isa 37:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"Zech 8:12\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(38,8,12)\">Zech 8:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 65:21\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"65\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"65\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(23,65,21)\">Isa 65:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Song 8:11\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(22,8,11)\">Song 8:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Song 8:12\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(22,8,12)\">Song 8:12</ref>, in figure <ref ref=\"Hos 10:11\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(28,10,11)\">Hos 10:11</ref> + 5 t. + <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:14\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,14)\">Ezek 17:14</ref> (but strike out <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup> and others); especially <bdbheb>הָעֵץ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>פ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 3:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,3,2)\">Gen 3:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 3:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,3,3)\">Gen 3:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 3:6\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(1,3,6)\">Gen 3:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 10:15\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(2,10,15)\">Exod 10:15</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>) + 21 t., also, in figure, <ref ref=\"Amos 2:9\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(30,2,9)\">Amos 2:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 9:16\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(28,9,16)\">Hos 9:16</ref> + 4 t. + <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:23\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,23)\">Ezek 17:23</ref> (read <bdbheb>פּאֹרָה</bdbheb> <highlight>branches</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup> and others); of gardens <ref ref=\"Amos 9:14\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(30,9,14)\">Amos 9:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 29:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,29,5)\">Jer 29:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 29:28\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(24,29,28)\">Jer 29:28</ref>, figurative <ref ref=\"Song 4:12\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(22,4,12)\">Song 4:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Song 4:16\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(22,4,16)\">Song 4:16</ref> <bdbheb>עֵץ פְּרִי</bdbheb> is <highlight>fruit-tree</highlight> <ref ref=\"Gen 1:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,11)\">Gen 1:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 148:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"148\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"148\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,148,9)\">Ps 148:9</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Eccl 2:5\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(21,2,5)\">Eccl 2:5</ref> <bdbheb>אֶרֶץ פְּרִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 107:34\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"107\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"107\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(19,107,34)\">Ps 107:34</ref> <bdbheb>פְּרִי תְּבוּאָךְ</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Ps 107:37\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"107\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"107\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(19,107,37)\">Ps 107:37</ref> <highlight>fruit of</highlight> (consisting in) <highlight>a crop</highlight>; <ref ref=\"Ps 72:16\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"72\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"72\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(19,72,16)\">Ps 72:16</ref> is dubious; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Che')\">Che</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Du')\">Du</lookup> interpret as <b>2</b>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bae')\">Bae</lookup> proposes <bdbheb>יִפְרוּ</bdbheb>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> = <highlight>offspring: fruit</highlight> of womb (<bdbheb>בֶּטֶן</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Gen 30:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,30,2)\">Gen 30:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 7:13\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(5,7,13)\">Deut 7:13</ref> + 9 t., compare <ref ref=\"Lam 2:20\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(25,2,20)\">Lam 2:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 21:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,21,11)\">Ps 21:11</ref> of cattle (<bdbheb>בְּהֵמָה</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Deut 28:4\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,4)\">Deut 28:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 28:11\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,11)\">Deut 28:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 28:51\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"51\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"51\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,51)\">Deut 28:51</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 30:9\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(5,30,9)\">Deut 30:9</ref> of serpent, figurative of power conquering Philistia <ref ref=\"Isa 14:29\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(23,14,29)\">Isa 14:29</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> figurative of <highlight>fruit</highlight> of actions, i.e. their consequences: good <ref ref=\"Isa 3:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,3,10)\">Isa 3:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 58:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"58\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"58\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,58,12)\">Ps 58:12</ref> bad <ref ref=\"Hos 10:13\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(28,10,13)\">Hos 10:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 1:31\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(20,1,31)\">Prov 1:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mic 7:13\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(33,7,13)\">Mic 7:13</ref>, of thoughts <ref ref=\"Jer 6:19\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(24,6,19)\">Jer 6:19</ref> of result of removing sin <ref ref=\"Isa 27:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,27,9)\">Isa 27:9</ref> result of labour (<highlight>fruit</highlight> of hands) <ref ref=\"Prov 31:16\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(20,31,16)\">Prov 31:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 31:31\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(20,31,31)\">Prov 31:31</ref> product of works of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 104:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"104\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"104\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,104,13)\">Ps 104:13</ref>, of wisdom <ref ref=\"Prov 8:19\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,19)\">Prov 8:19</ref> <bdbheb>צְדָקָה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>פ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 6:12\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(30,6,12)\">Amos 6:12</ref>, compare <bdbheb>צַדִּיק</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>פ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 11:30\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(20,11,30)\">Prov 11:30</ref> (read <bdbheb>צֶדֶק</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hi')\">Hi</lookup> Toy); of doings (i.e. course of life, or character) <ref ref=\"Jer 17:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,17,10)\">Jer 17:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 21:14\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(24,21,14)\">Jer 21:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 32:19\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(24,32,19)\">Jer 32:19</ref> <bdbheb>פִיאִֿישׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>פ</bdbheb> i.e. speech <ref ref=\"Prov 12:14\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(20,12,14)\">Prov 12:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 13:2\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(20,13,2)\">Prov 13:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 18:20\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(20,18,20)\">Prov 18:20</ref> <highlight>fruit</highlight> of arrogance <ref ref=\"Isa 10:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,12)\">Isa 10:12</ref> is arrogant speech; <highlight>fruit</highlight> of tongue <ref ref=\"Prov 18:21\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(20,18,21)\">Prov 18:21</ref> = consequences of speech. </p></div><hr><p>I, II. <bdbheb>פָּרָה</bdbheb> see III.  <bdbheb><reflink>פרר</reflink></bdbheb>. <bdbheb>פֶּרֶה</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>פֶּרֶא</reflink></bdbheb>. </p><hr><p>[<bdbheb>פֵּרָה</bdbheb>], <bdbheb>פֵּרוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 2:20\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(23,2,20)\">Isa 2:20</ref> see [ <bdbheb><reflink>חֲפַרְפָּרָה</reflink></bdbheb>].</p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Hos 14:9", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 14, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Hos 9:16", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 9, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Jer 12:12", "book": "JER", "chapter": 12, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Gen 4:3", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 4, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Prov 8:19", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 8, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Gen 3:6", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 3, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Ezek 36:8", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 36, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Amos 9:14", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 9, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Lam 2:20", "book": "LAM", "chapter": 2, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Ps 21:11", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 21, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Jer 29:28", "book": "JER", "chapter": 29, "verse": 28}, {"raw": "Jer 29:5", "book": "JER", "chapter": 29, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "